#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Minimal dav LLVM intrinsic functional simulator.

This is intentionally narrow: it supports a small f32 vector pipeline with GM
kernel arguments, explicit GM<->UB DMA, pset, vldsx1, vector compute intrinsics,
and vstsx1. It is a fast local preflight tool for OpenTileAS-produced LLVM IR,
not a cycle-accurate hardware simulator.
"""

